  const hero=`<section class="hero" id="home"><div class="shell">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy"><div class="kicker">Equipment-to-Process Systems</div><h1><span class="lang-ko">장치 물리에서 공정 시스템과<br>플랜트 의사결정까지</span><span class="lang-en">From equipment physics<br>to process and plant decisions</span></h1>
      <p class="lead"><span class="lang-ko">실험실 수준의 원천기술이 실제 공정 시스템으로 확장되는 과정에서 발생하는 장치 거동, 운전 제약, 설계 변수와 데이터 불확실성을 모델링·검증하고, 이를 공정 설계·최적화·실증 및 기술평가의 근거로 연결합니다.</span><span class="lang-en">We model and validate equipment behavior, operating constraints, design variables and data uncertainty as laboratory technologies are translated into real process systems, and use that evidence for process design, optimization, demonstration and technology assessment.</span></p>
      <div class="research-premise"><span class="lang-ko"><b>Research premise.</b> 장치 수준의 물리와 운전 제약이 공정의 feasible region, 시스템 성능, 지속가능성 및 scale-up 판단에 어떻게 전파되는지를 규명합니다.</span><span class="lang-en"><b>Research premise.</b> We examine how equipment-level physics and operating constraints propagate into process feasibility, system performance, sustainability and scale-up decisions.</span></div>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn primary" href="#research"><span class="lang-ko">연구 분야</span><span class="lang-en">Research areas</span></a><a class="btn" href="#people-detail"><span class="lang-ko">연구팀 및 협력자</span><span class="lang-en">People & collaborators</span></a></div>
      <div class="hero-stats"><div class="stat"><div>📄</div><div><b>13</b><span><span class="lang-ko">Peer-reviewed 논문<br>12 SCI(E) + 1 국내</span><span class="lang-en">Peer-reviewed papers<br>12 SCI(E) + 1 domestic</span></span></div></div><div class="stat"><div>💡</div><div><b>23</b><span><span class="lang-ko">국내 특허 기록<br>출원·등록 포함</span><span class="lang-en">Korean patent records<br>applications & grants</span></span></div></div><div class="stat"><div>🏅</div><div><b>12</b><span><span class="lang-ko">국내외 등록 특허</span><span class="lang-en">Patent grants<br>domestic & international</span></span></div></div><div class="stat"><div>🌐</div><div><b>5</b><span><span class="lang-ko">국제 특허 패밀리<br>KR · PCT · JP · US</span><span class="lang-en">International patent families<br>KR · PCT · JP · US</span></span></div></div></div></div>
      <div class="glass hero-philosophy"><div class="figure-copy"><div><div class="diagram-label"><span class="lang-ko">연구 철학</span><span class="lang-en">Research philosophy</span></div><h3 style="margin:0;color:#fff">Equipment-aware Process Systems</h3></div><p><span class="lang-ko">장치·공정·운전·평가를 하나의 검증 가능한 의사결정 체계로 연결합니다.</span><span class="lang-en">A verifiable evidence chain from equipment behavior to engineering decisions.</span></p></div>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 760 520"><defs><linearGradient id="v9ring" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#74d7d0"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#99d939"/></linearGradient></defs><circle cx="300" cy="258" r="190" fill="rgba(255,255,255,.018)" stroke="url(#v9ring)" stroke-width="4"/><circle cx="300" cy="258" r="108" fill="rgba(8,32,59,.72)" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.20)" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M300 258 L300 68 A190 190 0 0 1 481 199 Z" fill="rgba(22,160,163,.19)" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.14)"/><path d="M300 258 L481 199 A190 190 0 0 1 412 412 Z" fill="rgba(126,224,216,.16)" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.14)"/><path d="M300 258 L412 412 A190 190 0 0 1 188 412 Z" fill="rgba(153,217,57,.15)" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.14)"/><path d="M300 258 L188 412 A190 190 0 0 1 119 199 Z" fill="rgba(96,193,255,.14)" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.14)"/><path d="M300 258 L119 199 A190 190 0 0 1 300 68 Z" fill="rgba(255,255,255,.09)" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.14)"/><text x="300" y="231" text-anchor="middle" fill="#87ebe1" font-size="18" font-weight="900">E2P</text><text x="300" y="259" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="20" font-weight="900">Equipment-aware</text><text x="300" y="286" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="20" font-weight="900">Process Systems</text><text x="300" y="117" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="21" font-weight="800"><tspan class="lang-ko">장치</tspan><tspan class="lang-en">Equipment</tspan></text><text x="300" y="141" text-anchor="middle" fill="#d7e8ef" font-size="13"><tspan class="lang-ko">물리 · 성능 · 비이상 거동</tspan><tspan class="lang-en">physics · performance · non-ideality</tspan></text><text x="451" y="223" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="21" font-weight="800"><tspan class="lang-ko">공정</tspan><tspan class="lang-en">Process</tspan></text><text x="451" y="247" text-anchor="middle" fill="#d7e8ef" font-size="13">flowsheet · BOP · simulation</text><text x="395" y="401" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="21" font-weight="800"><tspan class="lang-ko">의사결정</tspan><tspan class="lang-en">Decision</tspan></text><text x="395" y="425" text-anchor="middle" fill="#d7e8ef" font-size="13"><tspan class="lang-ko">설계 · 최적화 · 배치</tspan><tspan class="lang-en">design · optimization · deployment</tspan></text><text x="205" y="401" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="21" font-weight="800"><tspan class="lang-ko">지속가능성</tspan><tspan class="lang-en">Sustainability</tspan></text><text x="205" y="425" text-anchor="middle" fill="#d7e8ef" font-size="13">LCA · TEA · value</text><text x="149" y="223" text-anchor="middle" fill="#fff" font-size="21" font-weight="800"><tspan class="lang-ko">운전</tspan><tspan class="lang-en">Operation</tspan></text><text x="149" y="247" text-anchor="middle" fill="#d7e8ef" font-size="13">dynamics · control · operability</text><line x1="492" y1="258" x2="535" y2="258" stroke="#7ee0d8" stroke-width="4"/><path d="M535 146 V390" fill="none" stroke="rgba(126,224,216,.52)" stroke-width="2"/><text x="560" y="155" fill="#fff" font-size="16" font-weight="850"><tspan class="lang-ko">공정 성능</tspan><tspan class="lang-en">Performance</tspan></text><text x="560" y="177" fill="#cfe2ea" font-size="12"><tspan class="lang-ko">효율 · 안정성 · 안전</tspan><tspan class="lang-en">efficiency · stability · safety</tspan></text><text x="560" y="226" fill="#fff" font-size="16" font-weight="850"><tspan class="lang-ko">실현 가능성</tspan><tspan class="lang-en">Feasibility</tspan></text><text x="560" y="248" fill="#cfe2ea" font-size="12"><tspan class="lang-ko">운전영역 · 제약 · 검증</tspan><tspan class="lang-en">operating envelope · constraints</tspan></text><text x="560" y="297" fill="#fff" font-size="16" font-weight="850"><tspan class="lang-ko">지속가능성</tspan><tspan class="lang-en">Sustainability</tspan></text><text x="560" y="319" fill="#cfe2ea" font-size="12"><tspan class="lang-ko">탄소 · 비용 · 자원</tspan><tspan class="lang-en">carbon · cost · resources</tspan></text><text x="560" y="368" fill="#fff" font-size="16" font-weight="850">Scale-up & Deployment</text><text x="560" y="390" fill="#cfe2ea" font-size="12"><tspan class="lang-ko">설계 기준 · 실증 · 적용</tspan><tspan class="lang-en">design basis · demonstration</tspan></text></svg></div>
    </div>
    <div class="methodology-map"><div class="methodology-head"><div><div class="diagram-label"><span class="lang-ko">연구 전환 프레임워크</span><span class="lang-en">Research translation framework</span></div><h3 style="margin:0;color:#fff"><span class="lang-ko">원천기술에서 시스템 의사결정까지의 연속성</span><span class="lang-en">A continuous evidence chain from source technology to system decisions</span></h3></div><p><span class="lang-ko">소재·반응기·환경평가, 산업 장치·BOP·플랜트 엔지니어링, 현재의 공정 시뮬레이션·디지털 트윈·최적화를 하나의 방법론으로 통합합니다.</span><span class="lang-en">Materials/reactor/environmental assessment, industrial equipment/BOP/plant engineering and current process simulation, digital-twin and optimization work are integrated in one framework.</span></p></div><div class="methodology-grid"><div class="method-step"><div class="n">01 · SOURCE TECHNOLOGY</div><b><span class="lang-ko">반응·소재·원리</span><span class="lang-en">Reaction & fundamentals</span></b><span>kinetics · catalyst · thermochemistry · electrochemistry</span></div><div class="method-arrow">→</div><div class="method-step"><div class="n">02 · EQUIPMENT</div><b><span class="lang-ko">장치 물리와 성능</span><span class="lang-en">Equipment physics</span></b><span>reactor · compressor · pump · heat exchanger · cell</span></div><div class="method-arrow">→</div><div class="method-step"><div class="n">03 · PROCESS & OPERATION</div><b><span class="lang-ko">공정 모델과 동적 운전</span><span class="lang-en">Process & dynamics</span></b><span>flowsheet · BOP · reduced model · control · operability</span></div><div class="method-arrow">→</div><div class="method-step"><div class="n">04 · EVIDENCE</div><b><span class="lang-ko">검증과 기술평가</span><span class="lang-en">Validation & assessment</span></b><span>design documents · demo data · uncertainty · LCA · TEA</span></div><div class="method-arrow">→</div><div class="method-step"><div class="n">05 · DECISION</div><b><span class="lang-ko">설계·스케일업·배치</span><span class="lang-en">Design & deployment</span></b><span>design basis · optimization · technology selection · implementation</span></div></div></div>
    <div class="principles-grid"><div class="principle"><div class="picon">E</div><div><b>Equipment Fidelity</b><span><span class="lang-ko">성능맵, 열·물질전달, 비이상 거동과 운전 제약을 모델 경계에 반영합니다.</span><span class="lang-en">Equipment performance, transport, non-ideal behavior and constraints define the model boundary.</span></span></div></div><div class="principle"><div class="picon">V</div><div><b>Model Credibility</b><span><span class="lang-ko">설계자료와 실증·운전 데이터로 유효 범위와 불확실성을 검증합니다.</span><span class="lang-en">Engineering and operating data establish model validity and uncertainty.</span></span></div></div><div class="principle"><div class="picon">A</div><div><b>Integrated Assessment</b><span><span class="lang-ko">정상상태 성능, 동특성, 운전성, LCA·TEA를 함께 평가합니다.</span><span class="lang-en">Performance, dynamics, operability, LCA and TEA are assessed together.</span></span></div></div><div class="principle"><div class="picon">D</div><div><b>Decision Relevance</b><span><span class="lang-ko">결과를 설계 기준, scale-up, 운전 정책과 기술 배치 판단으로 연결합니다.</span><span class="lang-en">Results are translated into design basis, scale-up, operating policy and deployment decisions.</span></span></div></div></div>
  </div></section>`;
