  const ip=`<section class="detail-section alt" id="ip-detail"><div class="shell"><div class="section-title-row"><div><div class="kicker"><span class="lang-ko">지식재산권 & 기술 패밀리</span><span class="lang-en">Intellectual Property & Technology Families</span></div><h2><span class="lang-ko">원리에서 장치로, 장치에서 실제 시스템으로</span><span class="lang-en">From scientific principles to deployable engineering</span></h2><p class="muted" style="max-width:900px"><span class="lang-ko">대표 family는 연구 정체성을 설명하는 서사 레이어이고, All IP는 전체 국내 포트폴리오를 확인하는 master registry입니다. 동일 우선권을 공유하는 국가별 문서는 하나의 family로 묶어 표시합니다.</span><span class="lang-en">Featured families provide the narrative layer of the portfolio, while All IP serves as the master registry of the domestic record. Jurisdictional documents sharing the same priority are grouped into one family.</span></p></div></div><div class="ip-intro"><div class="ip-manifesto"><div class="kicker"><span class="lang-ko">IP 철학</span><span class="lang-en">IP philosophy</span></div><h3><span class="lang-ko">특허 건수보다 기술이 실제 시스템으로 번역되는 경로를 제시합니다.</span><span class="lang-en">The portfolio emphasizes how technologies are translated into actual systems rather than the raw number of filings.</span></h3><p><span class="lang-ko">열·에너지 시스템, CO₂ 전환·해양 공정, 수소·수전해, 기능성 에너지 시스템의 포트폴리오를 대표 family와 전체 registry의 이중 구조로 구성합니다.</span><span class="lang-en">The portfolio spans thermal/energy systems, CO₂ conversion and marine process systems, hydrogen/electrolysis and functional energy systems, organized through representative families and a complete registry layer.</span></p></div><div class="ip-stat-grid"><div class="ip-stat"><b>23</b><span><span class="lang-ko">국내 IP 기록<br>portfolio count</span><span class="lang-en">Domestic IP records<br>portfolio count</span></span></div><div class="ip-stat"><b>12</b><span><span class="lang-ko">국내외 등록 특허</span><span class="lang-en">Domestic & international grants</span></span></div><div class="ip-stat"><b>5</b><span><span class="lang-ko">국제 특허 패밀리<br>KR · PCT · JP · US</span><span class="lang-en">International patent families<br>KR · PCT · JP · US</span></span></div><div class="ip-stat"><b>22+1</b><span><span class="lang-ko">파일 검증 현황<br>22개 공보 + 1건 pending</span><span class="lang-en">File-verification status<br>22 documents + 1 pending</span></span></div></div></div><div class="ip-tabbar"><button class="ip-tab-btn active" data-iptab="ip-featured-panel"><span class="lang-ko">대표 Families</span><span class="lang-en">Featured families</span></button><button class="ip-tab-btn" data-iptab="ip-cluster-panel"><span class="lang-ko">기술 클러스터</span><span class="lang-en">Technology clusters</span></button><button class="ip-tab-btn" data-iptab="ip-registry-panel">All IP</button></div><div class="ip-panel active" id="ip-featured-panel"><div class="ip-panel-header"><div><div class="kicker"><span class="lang-ko">대표 기술 패밀리</span><span class="lang-en">Selected technology families</span></div><h3><span class="lang-ko">한 발명을 국가별 건수로 부풀리지 않고 하나의 family로 관리합니다.</span><span class="lang-en">One invention, one family — with jurisdictional extensions shown transparently.</span></h3></div></div><div class="family-grid">${familyHTML}</div></div><div class="ip-panel" id="ip-cluster-panel"><div class="ip-panel-header"><div><div class="kicker"><span class="lang-ko">기술 클러스터</span><span class="lang-en">Technology clusters</span></div><h3><span class="lang-ko">도메인이 달라도 공통된 시스템 방법론으로 연결됩니다.</span><span class="lang-en">Different domains, connected through a common systems methodology.</span></h3></div></div><div class="ip-clusters">${clusterHTML}</div><div class="ip-bullet-list"><div class="white-card" style="padding:16px 18px"><b><span class="lang-ko">Portfolio logic</span><span class="lang-en">Portfolio logic</span></b><p class="muted" style="font-size:14px"><span class="lang-ko">소재 자체보다 장치·공정·운전 구조를 실제 시스템으로 확장하는 지식재산에 비중을 둡니다.</span><span class="lang-en">The portfolio emphasizes IP that extends technologies into equipment, process and operating structures.</span></p></div><div class="white-card" style="padding:16px 18px"><b><span class="lang-ko">Research continuity</span><span class="lang-en">Research continuity</span></b><p class="muted" style="font-size:14px"><span class="lang-ko">열에너지·CO₂·수전해라는 서로 다른 도메인은 모두 system feasibility, scale-up 및 engineering decision으로 수렴합니다.</span><span class="lang-en">Thermal energy, CO₂ and electrolysis converge on system feasibility, scale-up and engineering decisions.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="ip-panel" id="ip-registry-panel"><div class="ip-panel-header"><div><div class="kicker">All IP · Master Registry</div><h3><span class="lang-ko">대표 family 아래의 전체 국내 포트폴리오 증빙 레이어</span><span class="lang-en">The evidence layer containing the full domestic portfolio</span></h3></div><p><span class="lang-ko">현재 업로드된 국내 공보 22건을 기준으로 구성했으며, portfolio count 23건 중 1건은 원문 미업로드 상태로 pending 처리했습니다.</span><span class="lang-en">The registry is built from 22 uploaded Korean patent documents; one additional domestic record within the portfolio count of 23 remains pending until its source document is uploaded.</span></p></div><div class="ip-registry-wrap"><div class="ip-registry-filter"><button class="ip-filter-btn active" data-ipfilter="all">All</button><button class="ip-filter-btn" data-ipfilter="thermal">Thermal</button><button class="ip-filter-btn" data-ipfilter="carbon">Carbon / Marine</button><button class="ip-filter-btn" data-ipfilter="electrolysis">Electrolysis / H₂</button><button class="ip-filter-btn" data-ipfilter="functional">Functional</button><button class="ip-filter-btn" data-ipfilter="early">Earlier</button></div><table class="ip-registry-table"><thead><tr><th>No.</th><th>Filing / Publication</th><th><span class="lang-ko">발명의 명칭</span><span class="lang-en">Title</span></th><th><span class="lang-ko">단계</span><span class="lang-en">Stage</span></th><th><span class="lang-ko">도메인</span><span class="lang-en">Domain</span></th><th><span class="lang-ko">비고</span><span class="lang-en">Notes</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>${ipRows}</tbody></table><div class="ip-note"><span class="lang-ko">표기 원칙: 같은 발명이 여러 국가로 확장된 경우 대표 family에서 한 번만 설명하고, All IP는 국내 원문 공보를 기준으로 정리합니다. 공개·등록 여부는 업로드된 공보 기준으로 반영했습니다.</span><span class="lang-en">Display rule: when one invention extends into multiple jurisdictions, the family is described once in the featured section, while All IP is organized by Korean source documents. Publication/grant status follows the uploaded official documents.</span></div></div></div></div></section>`;
  const oldIp=d.querySelector('#ip-detail'); if(oldIp) oldIp.remove();
